<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Factory Card cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Factory Card cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it downgraded Factory Card Outlet Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- After the market closed on Wednesday, Factory Card said it expects its fourth quarter earnings to be in the range of $0.22 to $0.25 a share, falling short of the Wall Street consensus estimate of $0.34 a share, according to First Call.</p>
<p>-- Factory Card lost 3-3/8 to 5-1/2.</p>
</text>
